From 849a0c1814809ff66b5b7a574945f7bdac172a45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 03:08:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add elevators as vertical shaft infra with shared cars

Paint contiguous elevator cells into shafts (gaps and adjacent columns
are separate). Each shaft gets one car that calls to idle, boards up to
6 staff, multi-stops for dropoffs and same-direction pickups, and
forbids free vertical climbing while allowing horizontal walk-through.
